get to know someone else.

519
00:23:03,548 --> 00:23:05,175
Yeah, it's a bit difficult.

520
00:23:05,258 --> 00:23:09,221
Is it better to go all-in on one person?

521
00:23:10,305 --> 00:23:13,391
Honestly, I don't know.

522
00:23:13,475 --> 00:23:17,729
If I were to go all-in on someone,
I want it to be without any hesitation.

523
00:23:17,813 --> 00:23:20,982
Honestly, there's someone
I am still curious about

524
00:23:21,066 --> 00:23:24,361
and I don't want to feel like
I have to force myself to let go.

525
00:23:25,487 --> 00:23:26,655
Will you feel sure

526
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:30,242
if you had a conversation
with that other person?

527
00:23:30,826 --> 00:23:34,121
I don't know. I have no choice
but to compare you two.

528
00:23:34,746 --> 00:23:36,164
Because I don't like doing that,

529
00:23:36,248 --> 00:23:39,209
I want to hurry up
and talk with that person.

530
00:23:39,292 --> 00:23:41,461
I know it's very ironic.

531
00:23:41,545 --> 00:23:46,091
The reason why I asked you this
was because I was really just curious.

532
00:23:46,174 --> 00:23:50,387
It's not because I want to burden you

533
00:23:52,013 --> 00:23:54,850
